00:28:35.630 --> 00:28:50.089
Art A: it's not governed by the user. The user has no self-sovereignty associated with that. So we're seeing this idea of kind of hoarding personal information in deeper data silos that I think we need to start breaking down now. So the purpose of light governance, I guess, at the start, is to try to move

136
00:28:50.090 --> 00:28:56.989
Art A: through these membership levels and start to have… and we at the Varner Foundation are happy to take on the idea of, like, we will administer these kind of

137
00:28:57.190 --> 00:29:01.059
