00:47:38.890 --> 00:47:39.880
Lisa Dusseault (Data Transfer Initiative): Yep.

284
00:47:40.280 --> 00:47:52.040
Lisa Dusseault (Data Transfer Initiative): And then, after 5 years of it being an ITF thing, they took all of their extensions and built the XSF, the XMPP Standards Foundation. So they took all of the extensions back private.

285
00:47:53.860 --> 00:47:54.560
Art A: Yep.

